oo:\n245:All are in `paper2/data/certificates/failures.json`. The `DEFINITE_CEX`","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01BsdCMDhc13EqCvGf8RgjDc","session_id":"8829a219-b7d6-4bcd-a71b-6b4a7da5f863","uuid":"ed50a7a6-b728-43dc-81a5-14e463e349d5","timestamp":"2026-10-03T06:06:03.636Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Audit revised_algorithm.md numbers"}
